OL,3,GNEWSABoy in critical condition after
OL,4,Aincident at leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy is in a critical condition in
OL,7,Fhospital following an incident at a
OL,8,Fleisure centre in Staffordshire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FBurntwood Leisure Centre on High Street
OL,12,Fin Chasetown, at 13:08 BST on Sunday.
OL,14,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said
OL,15,Ftwo ambulances, a paramedic officer and
OL,16,Fthe Midlands Air Ambulance attended the
OL,17,Fscene. A boy was found in a critical
OL,18,Fcondition and was given specialist
OL,19,Ftrauma care before being taken to
OL,20,FBirmingham Children's Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
