OL,3,GNEWSABoy in critical condition after
OL,4,Aincident at leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leisure centre is operated by LWM
OL,7,FTraded Services Ltd, a company owned by
OL,8,FLichfield District Council. The BBC has
OL,9,Fapproached Staffordshire Police and the
OL,10,Fdistrict council for comment.
